---
/**
 * Brand Essence - "Beyond the Game"
 * Dani Bressel's vision, mission, and the "why" behind BRESSEL
 * Sentence case, human voice - no engineering jargon
 */
---

<section id="essence" class="py-28 md:py-36 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="container-custom">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Left: Content -->
      <div data-aos="fade-right">
        <p class="caption mb-4">Beyond the game</p>
        <h2>
          More than a sport.<br />
          <span class="text-bressel-red">A movement</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="body-lg mb-6">
          Dani Bressel saw a gap — great coaching was locked behind elite circles. He built BRESSEL to open the court to everyone.
        </p>

        <p class="body mb-8">
          Every player counts. Whether you're picking up a racket for the first time or chasing a tournament title, you'll find coaching that meets you where you are — and a community ready to raise each other up.
        </p>

        <!-- Signature stat -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-8 pt-4 border-t border-border">
          <div class="halo-accent">
            <p class="text-3xl font-header font-bold text-bressel-red">3</p>
            <p class="caption">Countries</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-3xl font-header font-bold text-bressel-red">50+</p>
            <p class="caption">Certified coaches</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-3xl font-header font-bold text-bressel-red">100+</p>
            <p class="caption">Tournaments</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Image (heritage / founder context) -->
      <div class="premium-card surge-mask overflow-hidden" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="150">
        <img
          src="/assets/coach/coach--Bressel-7533.webp"
          alt="BRESSEL coaching — beyond the game"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
